<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/CSP/0944-4756> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "top term heading for all specific disorders and diseases; a disease is a deviation from or interruption of the normal structure or function of any part, organ or system (or combination thereof) of the body that is manifested by a characteristic set of symptoms and signs; a disorder is a derangement or abnormality of function." .
<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/CSP/0944-4756> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
